  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{値|ね} (price, value) + {下|さ}げ (lowering, from {下|さ}げる)\n\nFORMS:\n{値下|ねさ}げする - to lower prices (transitive suru-verb)\n{値下|ねさ}げされる - prices are lowered (passive)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {値下|ねさ}げを{発表|はっぴょう}する - to announce a price reduction\n- {値下|ねさ}げ{交渉|こうしょう} - price negotiation\n- {大幅|おおはば}な{値下|ねさ}げ - significant price cut\n- {値下|ねさ}げ{競争|きょうそう} - price war\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {割引|わりびき} - discount\n- {安売|やすう}り - bargain sale\n- セール - sale\n- {値上|ねあ}げ - price increase",
